		{
			title: "在星空下安眠"
			x: -4.75d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "MOD : 舒适模组 (@comforts)"
			description: [
				"&b离家很远旅行时，睡在临时床上可不是个好主意，对吧？"
				""
				"&b但如果夜间身处险境，闲逛也不是好主意，待在由泥土和树枝搭成的棚子里，听到声响就跳起来，也很无聊。"
				""
				"&bFor that, bring yourself a Sleeping Bag! These comfortable beds won't reset your spawn point out in the wilds, and you can still pass the night quickly and safely!"
				""
				"&bBack at home, you can still sleep under the stars in a comfy Hammock! To set one up, you need two tree trunks, walls, pillars, or otherwise 4 blocks apart. You then Right Click a Rope and Nail onto each side of the wall, then Right Click your Hammock onto one of them to set it up!"
			]
