		{
			title: "探索自然"
			x: -2.5d
			y: 1.75d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Nature's Compass (@naturescompass)"
			description: [
				"&b很多时候，你探索并非为了探索，有时你会有明确的目的。你需要特定的材料、某种动物，或是适合建造的新地方。"
				""
				"&bAnd the FOPGame Server's somewhat erratic world generation layout and large number of biomes makes it tricky to find what you want sometimes."
				""
				"&b所以，FOP 为用户添加了一个叫自然罗盘的小工具。"
				""
